# The content files are edited in Notepad, which writes CRLF, and parsed by
# code that normalises line endings anyway. This is belt-and-braces: it keeps
# what is committed consistent regardless of the editor, so a diff never shows
# a whole file changed because someone opened it somewhere else.
*.txt text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.js text eol=lf
*.jsx text eol=lf
*.css text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf

# Binary, never touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.webp binary
*.svg text eol=lf
